# CONTROL, first half: the same task, the same sandbox, the same flag -- and no read
# from a labeled source. Every action here must SUCCEED under --ladder-taint.
#
# The gate is the taint, not the action. The broker calls below are byte-for-byte the
# ones rung 2 refuses in the ENFORCED block; what differs is that no untrusted source
# was read first.
#
# The page read here is the SAME FILE the enforced run reads, delivered to an
# unlabeled path. Reading it changes nothing, which is what makes the label a property
# of the source rather than of the bytes.

read-source /scratch/benign-page.txt --obey-instructions

# The task's own work, in full.
call-broker read_wiki deploy-runbook
call-broker write_config retention_days 30
probe-egress wiki.corp --via-proxy ${LADDER_PROXY}
